-/**
-*  @brief   Read data DMAed to memory
-*
-*  This function will read data that has been DMAed to memory while 
transferring from:
-*          - Memory to memory
-*          - Peripheral to memory
-*
-*  @param    handle     -
-*  @param    ppBbuf     -
-*  @param    pLen       -
-*
-*  @return  0 - No more data is available to read
-*           1 - More data might be available to read
-*
