-/****************************************************************************/
-/**
-*  @brief   Set descriptor carrying control information
-*
-*  This function will be used to send specific control information to 
the device
-*  using the DMA channel
-*
-*
-*  @return  -1 - On failure
-*            0 - On success
-*
-*  @note
-*     None
